'''Graveflower Verbena''' is an [[:Category:Uber Rare Cats|Uber Rare Cat]] that was added in [[Version 6.4 Update|Version 6.4]] and can be obtained by playing the [[Cat Capsule#Rare Capsule|Rare Capsule]] during the [[Girls & Monsters: Angels of Terror (Gacha Event)|Girls & Monsters: Angels of Terror]] and [[METAL BUSTERS (Gacha Event)|METAL BUSTERS]] events. [[True Form]] added in [[Version 9.6 Update|Version 9.6]] increased health and critical chance. [[Talents]] were added in [[Version 13.5 Update|Version 13.5]] and Ultra Talents were added in [[Version 16.0 Update|Version 16.0]].

