==Talents==
*'''[[Critical]]''': Upgrades Critical Hit chance by 1% per level up to 10% (Total Cost: 175 NP)
*'''[[Survive]]''': Adds a 28% chance to survive a lethal strike, improves by 8% per level up to 100% (Total Cost: 235 NP)
*'''[[Special Abilities#Resist|Resist Freeze]]''': Reduces freeze duration by 16%, improves by 6% per level up to 70% (Total Cost: 175 NP)
*'''[[Special Abilities#Stat Enhancements|Hp Buff]]''': Upgrades health by 2% per level up to 20% (Total Cost: 175 NP)
*'''[[Special Abilities#Stat Enhancements|Attack Buff]]''': Upgrades attack power by 2% per level up to 20% (Total Cost: 175 NP)

==='''Ultra Talents'''===
*'''Unlock Cat Combo''': Unlocks the "骨まで愛して" Cat Combo (Cost: 150 NP)
*'''[[Surge Attacks|Surge Attack]]''': Adds a 5% chance to create a level 1 surge attack between 345~695 range, improves by 5% per level up to 50% (Total Cost: 235 NP)
*'''[[Special Abilities#Stat Enhancements|HP Buff+]]''': Upgrades health by 10% per level up to 50% (Total Cost: 100 NP)

