==Trivia==
*Graveflower Verbena first became obtainable in [[Nyanko Daisensou|BCJP]] alongside [[Wolfchild Deale (Uber Rare Cat)|Wolfchild Deale]] on September 8th, 2017.
*She may be a reference to [[wikia:corpsebride:Emily|Emily]] from [[wikipedia:Corpse Bride|Corpse Bride]].
*Her name is derived from the flower genus [[wikipedia:Verbena|Verbena]], however they are not typically considered as traditional burial flowers.
*As of [[Version 16.0 Update|Version 16.0]], she is the first instance in where [[Cat Combo]]s can be unlocked via talents.

